-- That context grounds to `Eq Opaque`, which has no instance anywhere in this
-- program. SPEC ANSWER, hand-derived before any binary was run: REJECT.
--
-- 🚨 MEASURED AS A SILENT FALSE ACCEPT ON A BASE BINARY cold-built from
