-- 0 printing 1, `build` exit 0, executed binary printing 1. The checker reached
-- ZMOD's row by SPELLING and discharged ITS empty context in place of amod's —
-- so a program whose selected impl declares an unsatisfiable constraint ran to
-- completion with no diagnostic. On this binary all three verbs reject with
-- `T-NO-IMPL`.
--
-- ⚠️ THE VALUE 1 IS WHAT MAKES IT SOUNDNESS AND NOT MERELY ACCEPTANCE. 1 is
